{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to ask about therapy, session types, or scheduling. Confidential intake and clear boundaries described.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfc;
      --panel:#ffffff;
      --muted:#6b7280;
      --accent:#6b3f99;
      --accent-2:#f6a623;
      --card-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(31,41,55,0.08);
      --radius:12px;
      --max-width:1100px;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#0f172a}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:40px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#8b5cf6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;margin-top:20px}
    .hero-left{background:url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat;padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--card-shadow);background-color:var(--panel)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}

    .contact-card{background:var(--panel);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--card-shadow)}
    .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Proof Gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,63,153,0.03),transparent);}
    .carousel{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--card-shadow)}
    .slides{display:flex;transition:transform 400ms ease}
    .slide{min-width:100%;padding:8px}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#111827}
    .attribution{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .carousel-controls{position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;display:flex;gap:8px}
    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);padding:6px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}

    .badges{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center}
    .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eef2ff;cursor:help;position:relative}
    .badge svg{width:18px;height:18px}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#0f172a;color:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;display:none}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}

    /* Accordion */
    .accordion{margin-top:18px;background:transparent}
    .acc-item{border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel);margin-bottom:10px;padding:12px;box-shadow:var(--card-shadow)}
    .acc-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
    .acc-body{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);display:none}
    .acc-head[aria-expanded="true"] + .acc-body{display:block}

    footer{margin-top:20px;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(246,166,35,0.06));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .crisis{font-size:13px;color:#7c2d00}

    @media (max-width:920px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .hero-left{order:2}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">TP</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
        <a href="approach.html">My Approach</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQs</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="hero">
      <section class="hero-left">
        <h1>Reach out when you want to explore what matters next</h1>
        <p class="lead">I’m a licensed clinician offering time-limited and ongoing options. Use the form to share what feels important — I’ll reply with scheduling options and next steps.</p>

        <div class="proof">
          <div class="carousel" id="carousel">
            <div class="carousel-controls">
              <button class="btn-ghost" id="prev" aria-label="Previous">◀</button>
              <button class="btn-ghost" id="next" aria-label="Next">▶</button>
            </div>
            <div class="slides" id="slides">
              <div class="slide">
                <div class="quote">"I felt genuinely heard from our first session. There was real attention to how I live day-to-day, not just talk about it."</div>
                <div class="attribution">— Client, workplace stress</div>
              </div>
              <div class="slide">
                <div class="quote">"Short, focused sessions helped me build a practical routine. The clinician gave me tools I could try between appointments."</div>
                <div class="attribution">— Client, life transition</div>
              </div>
              <div class="slide">
                <div class="quote">"I appreciated clear boundaries about confidentiality and what therapy can address. That clarity made it easier to begin."</div>
                <div class="attribution">— Client, anxiety</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="badges" aria-hidden="false">
            <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3" stroke="#6b3f99" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6" stroke="#6b3f99" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              <div>Licensed Clinician
                <div class="tooltip">Licensed in {{STATE}} — clinical training aligned with professional standards</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="3" stroke="#f6a623" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none"/><path d="M7 10h10" stroke="#f6a623" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              <div>10+ Years in Practice
                <div class="tooltip">A decade of clinical work across individual and group settings</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 2l3 6h6l-4.8 3.6L20 20l-8-5-8 5 1.8-8.4L1 8h6l3-6z" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/></svg>
              <div>Supervision & Training
                <div class="tooltip">Regular clinical supervision and ongoing professional education</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion" id="accordion">
          <div class="acc-item">
            <div class="acc-head" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0">Session boundaries — what to expect
              <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">▼</span>
            </div>
            <div class="acc-body">
              <p class="small">Sessions typically run 50 minutes unless a different length is arranged. Please arrive on time; late starts shorten the session so other clients’ time is respected. If you need to cancel, I ask for 48 hours' notice when possible so the slot can be offered to others. Fees may apply for late cancellations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <div class="acc-head" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0">Confidentiality & limits
              <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">▼</span>
            </div>
            <div class="acc-body">
              <p class="small">Your conversations are confidential and used to provide care, document progress, and coordinate treatment when needed. Exceptions include situations required by law: imminent risk of harm to self or others, suspected abuse of a vulnerable person, or court orders. If coordination with other professionals is helpful, I will ask for consent first.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <div class="acc-head" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0">Scope of practice
              <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">▼</span>
            </div>
            <div class="acc-body">
              <p class="small">I provide psychotherapy and clinical consultation. I do not provide emergency medical care or psychiatric medication management. If your needs extend beyond my scope, I will discuss appropriate referrals and supports.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside class="contact-card">
        <form id="contactForm" aria-label="Contact form">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Get in touch</div>
            <div class="small">Prefer to call? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="sessionType">Session preference</label>
            <select id="sessionType" name="sessionType">
              <option>Traditional Session — 50 min</option>
              <option>Short Focus — 30 min</option>
              <option>Concise Breakthrough — three-session focus</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="message">Message — what would you like to address?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A few sentences helps me respond with options"></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label>
              <input type="checkbox" id="addon" name="addon"> Add guided workbook packet (optional)
            </label>
            <div class="small">A practical, clinician-guided workbook you can keep between sessions.</div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
            <button type="submit" class="cta" id="primaryCta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="small" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">Or choose a time on the booking page</a>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">By contacting, you agree to receive a response about scheduling and practice policies. I will follow up via email or phone.</div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed #eef2ff;padding-top:12px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Practical details</div>
          <div class="small">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. I offer telehealth and in-person appointments where appropriate. Insurance: I provide receipts for out-of-network reimbursement; direct billing depends on your plan.</div>
        </div>

      </aside>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">Confidential inquiries</div>
        <div class="small">All contacts are treated with professional discretion. Questions about privacy or documentation are welcome.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="crisis">
        If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services. In the United States, dial 988 for the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline; if you are elsewhere, contact local emergency resources.
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Carousel
    (function(){
      const slides = document.getElementById('slides');
      const total = slides.children.length;
      let index = 0;
      let timer = null;
      function go(i){
        index = (i + total) % total;
        slides.style.transform = `translateX(-${index * 100}%)`;
      }
      function next(){ go(index+1); }
      function prev(){ go(index-1); }
      document.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ next(); reset(); });
      document.getElementById('prev').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ prev(); reset(); });
      function start(){ timer = setInterval(next,4000); }
      function reset(){ clearInterval(timer); start(); }
      slides.parentElement.addEventListener('mouseenter', ()=> clearInterval(timer));
      slides.parentElement.addEventListener('mouseleave', ()=> start());
      start();
    })();

    // Accordion
    (function(){
      const items = document.querySelectorAll('.acc-item .acc-head');
      items.forEach(head=>{
        head.addEventListener('click', toggle);
        head.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') toggle(); });
        function toggle(){
          const currently = head.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
          head.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !currently);
        }
      });
    })();

    // Contact form behavior (local-only)
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      const cta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        cta.textContent = 'Sending…';
        cta.disabled = true;
        // Simulate send
        setTimeout(()=>{
          cta.textContent = 'Message sent';
          alert('Thanks — I will respond within 48 hours with next steps.');
          form.reset();
          cta.textContent = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
          cta.disabled = false;
        },900);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the private practice therapist template (chunk 4).

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — The clinician-written contact page with intake form, rotating testimonials, credibility badges with tooltips, and an accordion covering session boundaries and confidentiality. Includes a respectful crisis footer.

Purpose and features:
- Warm, clinician voice that follows professional limits: confidentiality, scope boundaries, and crisis instructions are clearly stated.
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials implemented with local JavaScript; credibility badges show brief tooltips on hover/focus.
- Session boundaries + confidentiality accordion: accessible headings with aria attributes; keyboard interaction supported (Enter/Space to toggle).
- Contact form: collects basic intake details and offers an optional "guided workbook" add-on checkbox that represents the retail_addon offer model (no external commerce integration). Form submission is simulated client-side.
- Nav uses an alternate label set: Welcome, My Approach, Areas, Rates, FAQs, Book, Connect.
- No external assets or CDNs are required. The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for a decorative background pattern — ensure that file exists in the assets/img directory for the full visual effect.

Placeholders to replace in the final site build:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility notes:
- Carousel pauses on hover and is controllable with previous/next buttons.
- Badges are keyboard focusable and reveal tooltips on hover or focus.
- Accordion items use aria-expanded state and respond to keyboard events.

Therapist/legal notes:
- No medical claims or guarantees are made.
- Clear mention of limits to confidentiality and instructions for crisis situations are present. The crisis guidance points users to emergency services and to the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline (988) for U.S.-based callers. Modify locale-specific crisis information as appropriate.

Integration tips:
- Hook the contact form into your scheduling or CRM system by replacing the simulated submit handler with an AJAX call to your backend.
- Supply assets/img/pattern.svg with a unique SVG pattern for visual identity.
- Update the placeholders with real practice details.

Design/UX ideas:
- Consider adding server-side validation and reCAPTCHA if needed for production.
- Keep wording consistent across other pages to maintain a coherent therapeutic voice.

End of chunk 4 README."}
BUNDLE_END
